<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1820199775"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:55.584"><div begin="21.260" end="38.510" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="21.260" end="23.526" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.260" end="21.674">快要</span><span begin="21.674" end="22.026">去</span><span begin="22.026" end="22.208">到</span><span begin="22.208" end="22.795">圣殿</span><span begin="22.795" end="23.526">吧</span></p><p begin="23.592" end="25.926" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.592" end="24.120">差点</span><span begin="24.120" end="24.390">登</span><span begin="24.390" end="24.585">峰</span><span begin="24.585" end="25.196">的刹</span><span begin="25.196" end="25.926">那</span></p><p begin="26.046" end="28.995" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.046" end="26.440">有伏</span><span begin="26.440" end="26.799">线</span> <span begin="26.799" end="26.981">但</span><span begin="26.981" end="27.833">你没有</span><span begin="27.833" end="28.154">升</span><span begin="28.154" end="28.995">华</span></p><p begin="30.850" end="33.059" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.850" end="31.295">太快</span><span begin="31.295" end="31.608">跳</span><span begin="31.608" end="31.806">到</span><span begin="31.806" end="32.396">结局</span><span begin="32.396" end="33.059">吧</span></p><p begin="33.172" end="35.443" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.172" end="33.674">加些</span><span begin="33.674" end="33.996">花</span><span begin="33.996" end="34.178">边</span><span begin="34.178" end="34.798">不好</span><span begin="34.798" end="35.443">吗</span></p><p begin="35.530" end="38.510" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.530" end="36.049">你有</span><span begin="36.049" end="36.335">顾</span><span begin="36.335" end="36.547">忌</span> <span begin="36.547" end="37.693">趁热除下</span><span begin="37.693" end="38.510">它</span></p></div><div begin="39.778" end="58.014" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.778" end="43.611" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3